1. Definitions

"Software" means the Interleaf Reader source code, documentation, and project
files distributed with this license, unless a specific file states a different
license.

"Non-commercial" means use that is not primarily intended for commercial
advantage, monetary compensation, paid services, paid products, commercial
deployment, or business operations.

"Commercial use" includes selling the Software, packaging it as a paid app,
offering it as a paid SaaS or service, deploying it commercially, using it as
part of a paid product or paid course product, integrating it into a commercial
closed-source product, or monetizing modified versions.

